                       "description":  "CostByTargetAppChart shows a horizontal bar chart sorted by cost descending. Custom tooltip shows app name, cost ($X.XX), calls, input/output tokens, and avg duration. Uses hsl(var(--chart-3)) fill. CostPerInteractionChart shows vertical bars with first 20 task runs, x-axis shows truncated run IDs, y-axis shows cost ($X.XX). PageComplexityTable has 4 columns: Page URL (monospace truncated), Calls, Total Cost, Avg/Call (bold). Sorted by avg cost descending. Sticky header with max-h-64 scroll.",
